00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.940
Well, I mean, yeah, I guess that's not that much time,

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.480
Hang on! Let's hold on here a second.
I wonder what's inside.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.120
Alright, let's see what is inside the shed
before we do anything.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.160
Oh.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.660
